#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:4
msgid "Step 4: Dynamic Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:6
msgid ""
"This step shows how to detect memory errors with two tools: AddressSanitizer "
"and Valgrind."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:9
msgid ""
"Unlike the other steps, this one builds its own project in the ``Step4/"
"Project`` directory.  Its source file writes to memory after it is freed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:13
msgid "Step4/Project/use_after_free.c"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:13
msgid ""
"#include <stdio.h>\n"
"#include <stdlib.h>\n"
"#include <string.h>\n"
"\n"
"int main(void)\n"
"{\n"
"  char* s = malloc(100);\n"
"  free(s);\n"
"  /* Bug: this writes to memory that was already freed. */\n"
"  strcpy(s, \"Hello world!\");\n"
"  printf(\"string is: %s\\n\", s);\n"
"  return 0;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:17
msgid ""
"Both scripts call :command:`ctest_memcheck` instead "
"of :command:`ctest_test`. This runs each test under the analysis tool, "
"collects the problems it reports, and submits them to CDash separately from "
"the test results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:22
msgid "AddressSanitizer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:24
msgid ""
"AddressSanitizer is built into GCC and Clang.  The project is compiled with "
"``-fsanitize=address``, and the tests report memory errors when they run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:27
msgid "Step4/asan.cmake"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:27
msgid ""
"set(CTEST_BUILD_NAME \"Step4: AddressSanitizer\")\n"
"site_name(CTEST_SITE)\n"
"set(CTEST_SOURCE_DIRECTORY \"${CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY}/Project\")\n"
"set(CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR \"Unix Makefiles\")\n"
"set(CTEST_NOTES_FILES \"${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_FILE}\")\n"
"\n"
"set(CTEST_UPDATE_COMMAND \"git\")\n"
"set(CTEST_UPDATE_VERSION_ONLY 1)\n"
"\n"
"set(CTEST_USE_LAUNCHERS 1)\n"
"set(CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY \"${CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY}/build-asan\")\n"
"\n"
"# Tell CTest that the tests use AddressSanitizer, so that it knows how to\n"
"# parse their output.\n"
"set(CTEST_MEMORYCHECK_TYPE \"AddressSanitizer\")\n"
"\n"
"ctest_empty_binary_directory(\"${CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY}\")\n"
"\n"
"ctest_start(Experimental)\n"
"ctest_update()\n"
"\n"
"# Build with the -fsanitize=address flag to enable AddressSanitizer.\n"
"set(options\n"
"  \"-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug\"\n"
"  \"-DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-fsanitize=address\"\n"
"  )\n"
"ctest_configure(OPTIONS \"${options}\")\n"
"\n"
"ctest_build()\n"
"\n"
"# Run the tests with dynamic analysis instead of calling ctest_test().\n"
"ctest_memcheck()\n"
"\n"
"ctest_submit()\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:31
msgid ""
"Setting :variable:`CTEST_MEMORYCHECK_TYPE` tells CTest how to parse the "
"sanitizer output, so that it can report each problem to CDash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:34
msgid "ctest -S Step4/asan.cmake -V"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:39
msgid "Valgrind"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:41
msgid ""
"Valgrind runs each test executable under its own instrumentation, so it "
"needs no special compiler flags.  It is more portable but slower than ASan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:44
msgid "Step4/valgrind.cmake"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:44
msgid ""
"set(CTEST_BUILD_NAME \"Step4: Valgrind\")\n"
"site_name(CTEST_SITE)\n"
"set(CTEST_SOURCE_DIRECTORY \"${CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY}/Project\")\n"
"set(CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR \"Unix Makefiles\")\n"
"set(CTEST_NOTES_FILES \"${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_FILE}\")\n"
"\n"
"set(CTEST_UPDATE_COMMAND \"git\")\n"
"set(CTEST_UPDATE_VERSION_ONLY 1)\n"
"\n"
"set(CTEST_USE_LAUNCHERS 1)\n"
"set(CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY \"${CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY}/build-valgrind\")\n"
"\n"
"# Run the tests under Valgrind.\n"
"find_program(CTEST_MEMORYCHECK_COMMAND NAMES valgrind)\n"
"\n"
"ctest_empty_binary_directory(\"${CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY}\")\n"
"\n"
"ctest_start(Experimental)\n"
"ctest_update()\n"
"ctest_configure()\n"
"ctest_build()\n"
"\n"
"# Run the tests with dynamic analysis instead of calling ctest_test().\n"
"ctest_memcheck()\n"
"\n"
"ctest_submit()\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Dynamic Analysis.rst:48
msgid "ctest -S Step4/valgrind.cmake -V"
msgstr ""

